constraints:
1 <= Number of nodes <= 10^{4}
1 <= Data of a node <= 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(N).
expected auxiliary space: O(Height of the Tree).

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def findDist(self, root, a, b):

		def LCA(root, path, tar):
			if root == None:
				return
			if root.data == tar:
				self.ans.append(path + [root.data])
			LCA(root.left, path + [root.data], tar)
			LCA(root.right, path + [root.data], tar)
		self.ans = []
		LCA(root, [], a)
		ans1 = self.ans[0]
		self.ans = []
		LCA(root, [], b)
		ans2 = self.ans[0]
		for i in range(min(len(ans1), len(ans2))):
			if ans1[i] == ans2[i]:
				val = i + 1
			else:
				return len(ans1) + len(ans2) - 2 * val
		return len(ans1) + len(ans2) - 2 * val
